From 847c9c27c2f10da4c6f09cff672da0179e2bd07c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Joseph Crowell <joseph.w.crowell@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 11:54:22 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Only delete input devices the connection created

On a hierarchy change xi2SetupDevices() deleted every registered
QInputDevice missing from X, including ones the application registered
itself, which then crashed when the application deleted them again.

Signed-off-by: Joseph Crowell <joseph.w.crowell@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit 08f86a4f74326b2c75f1f56e412fdf6dc2c40d26)
---
